    "description": "Autumn 🍂 in Nangma valley gives Hollywood movie vibes 🎥 \n\nCan you spot my camp ⛺️ in yellow? The orange one belonged to a Malaysian group.\n\n#nangmavalley #autumn #hollywood #lotr #lordoftherings #middleearth #djiglobal #earthpix #beautifuldestinations #wonderful_places #kanday #gilgitbaltistan #pakistan #trekking #hiking #sheraliphotography #reels #outdoors #mountains #yosemite #reelsinstagram #viralreels #dronevideo #djimavicmini3pro #explorepage \n\n[Nangma Valley, located in Kanday, Ghanche, Gilgit Baltistan, Pakistan 🇵🇰, is a breathtaking gem filled with soaring granite spires, verdant meadows, and untouched alpine beauty, and the remote valley beckons trekkers.\n\nAn easy Trek from Kanday town will take you to the beautiful Nangma Valley, known as the heaven of rock climbing and famous for its natural beauty.]",
